1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,800
What does each side get?

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:07,764
Investors get a checked value, the same update at the same time, proof of ownership, and dividends on time.

3
00:00:07,764 --> 00:00:17,669
In return, the business keeps a live share register, as Australian and Vietnamese law already require, reports on schedule, and has a person approve every new share and dividend.

